our engagement</span><span class="svc-price" data-astro-cid-3qr4z3tf>from $2.95</span></a></li></ul></section></div></div></section><section class="section section-sunken" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="container" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head" data-astro-cid-jzxutsks><h2 data-astro-cid-jzxutsks="true">How ordering works</h2><p data-astro-cid-jzxutsks>Four steps, about a minute in total.</p></div><ol class="steps" data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><li data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>1</span><div data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><h3 data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Pick a service</h3><p data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Choose the platform and what you want to grow. Packages start at $2.95.</p></div></li><li data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>2</span><div data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><h3 data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Choose a size</h3><p data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Start small if you are new to us. You can always order again once you see how it works.</p></div></li><li data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>3</span><div data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><h3 data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Enter your username</h3><p data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Or paste a link to the post. Your account needs to be public so we can deliver.</p></div></li><li data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><span class="step-num" data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>4</span><div data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy><h3 data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Pay and watch</h3><p data-astro-cid-yb26x6oy>Card, Apple Pay or crypto. Your order starts on its own within a few minutes.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class="section" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="container" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head" data-astro-cid-jzxutsks><h2 data-astro-cid-jzxutsks="true">Why people order from us</h2><p data-astro-cid-jzxutsks>No passwords, no waiting around, and a real person if something goes wrong.</p></div><ul class="feature-grid" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><li class="card" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><span class="feature-icon" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 10V8a6 6 0 1112 0v2M5 10h14v11H5z"></path></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>We never ask for your password</h3><p data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>Every order needs one thing: your public username, or a link to the post. If a growth site ever asks you to log in, close the tab.</p></li><li class="card" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><span class="feature-icon" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13H11l-1 9 8.5-11H12l1-9z"></path></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>Orders start in minutes</h3><p data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>Most orders begin within a few minutes of payment. Larger ones arrive gradually so the jump does not look odd on your profile.</p></li><li class="card" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><span class="feature-icon" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 11a8 8 0 10-2.3 5.7M20 5v6h-6"></path></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>Free refills if numbers drop</h3><p data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>Some drop-off is normal on every platform. If your count falls below what you paid for, message us and we top it back up.</p></li><li class="card" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><span class="feature-icon" data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 00-9 9v4a3 3 0 003 3h1v-7H5v0a7 7 0 0114 0v0h-2v7h1a3 3 0 003-3v-4a9 9 0 00-9-9z"></path></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>A person answers, seven days a week</h3><p data-astro-cid-kk24rp7s>Write to us and a real person writes back. If an order is late or wrong, we fix it or refund it under our refund policy.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class="section section-sunken" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="container" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head" data-astro-cid-jzxutsks><h2 data-astro-cid-jzxutsks="true">What our customers say</h2><p data-astro-cid-jzxutsks>Reviews collected by Trustindex from real GetLikes buyers.</p></div><div class="reviews" data-astro-cid-67ep6ump><div class="ti-widget-anchor-58b9f9c202799436879656f5bca" data-src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/loader.js?58b9f9c202799436879656f5bca" data-astro-cid-67ep6ump></div></div><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`.reviews [data-src]`);if(e){let t=()=>{let t=document.createElement(`script`);t.src=e.dataset.src,t.defer=!0,e.appendChild(t)},n=new IntersectionObserver(e=>{e.some(e=>e.isIntersecting)&&(n.disconnect(),t())},{rootMargin:`320px`});n.observe(e)}</script></div></section><section class="section" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="container" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head" data-astro-cid-jzxutsks><h2 data-astro-cid-jzxutsks="true">Free tools, no account needed</h2><p data-astro-cid-jzxutsks>Use them as much as you like. Nothing to sign up for.</p></div><ul class="tools-grid" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/free-instagram-followers/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Free Instagram Followers</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Try before you buy</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/free-instagram-likes/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Free Instagram Likes</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>A free sample of likes</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/free-instagram-views/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Free Instagram Views</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>A free sample of views</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/instagram-bio-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Instagram Bio Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Write a better bio</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/instagram-caption-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Instagram Caption Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Captions in seconds</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/instagram-follower-counter/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Instagram Follower Counter</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Live follower count</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/instagram-font-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Instagram Font Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Fancy fonts for your bio</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/instagram-hashtag-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Instagram Hashtag Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Find hashtags that work</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/tiktok-counter/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>TikTok Counter</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Live TikTok stats</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/tiktok-hashtag-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>TikTok Hashtag Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Trending TikTok tags</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/tiktok-username-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>TikTok Username Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Find a name that is free</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><a href="/youtube-tag-generator/" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj><span class="tg-label" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>YouTube Tag Generator</span><span class="tg-blurb" data-astro-cid-aznjfcqj>Tags that get you found</span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="section section-sunken" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="container" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head" data-astro-cid-jzxutsks><h2 data-astro-cid-jzxutsks="true">Learn how growth actually works</h2><p data-astro-cid-jzxutsks>Plain-English guides on followers, likes, views and the algorithms behind them. Checked against the platforms&#39; own rules.</p></div><div class="guide-grid" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><article class="gcard is-instagram" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><a href="/guides/how-to-get-more-followers-on-instagram/" class="gcard-link" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><div class="gcard-art" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><img src="/_astro/instagram-followers.BBJJlmcn_Z19JEH7.webp" srcset="/_astro/instagram-followers.BBJJlmcn_Z19JEH7.webp 240w, /_astro/instagram-followers.BBJJlmcn_2j7wMX.webp 480w" alt="An Instagram profile with a rising follower count" sizes="(max-width: 560px) 90vw, 240px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="240" height="240"></div><div class="gcard-body" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><p class="gcard-tag" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#social-instagram"></use></svg><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Followers</span></p><h3 class="gcard-title" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m="true">How to get more followers on Instagram</h3><p class="gcard-desc" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Instagram followers come from Reels, a searchable name field and a steady rhythm. Here is what moves the number, the steps in order, and what does not work.</p><p class="gcard-meta" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>9 min read</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>·</span><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Updated Sep 2026</span></p></div></a></article><article class="gcard is-tiktok" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><a href="/guides/how-many-followers-to-go-live-on-tiktok/" class="gcard-link" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><div class="gcard-art" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><img src="/_astro/get-tiktok-followers.DVVbpK9s_2cJ0vK.webp" srcset="/_astro/get-tiktok-followers.DVVbpK9s_2cJ0vK.webp 240w, /_astro/get-tiktok-followers.DVVbpK9s_19OUp3.webp 480w" alt="A TikTok follower count climbing toward 1,000" sizes="(max-width: 560px) 90vw, 240px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="240" height="193"></div><div class="gcard-body" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><p class="gcard-tag" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#social-tiktok"></use></svg><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Followers</span></p><h3 class="gcard-title" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m="true">How many followers do you need to go live on TikTok?</h3><p class="gcard-desc" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>How many followers do you need to go live on TikTok? TikTok publishes an age rule, not a number. Creators report 1,000. What is official, and how to get there.</p><p class="gcard-meta" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>6 min read</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>·</span><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Updated Sep 2026</span></p></div></a></article><article class="gcard is-instagram" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><a href="/guides/how-to-check-for-fake-instagram-followers/" class="gcard-link" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><div class="gcard-art" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><img src="/_astro/instagram-followers.BBJJlmcn_Z19JEH7.webp" srcset="/_astro/instagram-followers.BBJJlmcn_Z19JEH7.webp 240w, /_astro/instagram-followers.BBJJlmcn_2j7wMX.webp 480w" alt="An Instagram followers list being checked one account at a time" sizes="(max-width: 560px) 90vw, 240px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="240" height="240"></div><div class="gcard-body" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><p class="gcard-tag" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#social-instagram"></use></svg><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Buying safely</span></p><h3 class="gcard-title" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m="true">How to check for fake Instagram followers in five minutes</h3><p class="gcard-desc" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>You do not need an app or a password to spot fake Instagram followers. Here are the signs, a five-minute manual check, and how to remove ghost followers.</p><p class="gcard-meta" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>7 min read</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>·</span><span data-astro-cid-yjby3j6m>Updated Sep 2026</span></p></div></a></article></div><p class="guide-more" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><a href="/guides/" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme>Browse all guides</a></p></div></section><section class="section" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="container container-narrow" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme><div class="sec-head" data-astro-cid-jzxutsks><h2 data-astro-cid-jzxutsks="true">Questions people ask first</h2><p data-astro-cid-jzxutsks>The honest answers, including what buying engagement will not do.</p></div><div class="faq" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><details open data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>How much does it cost to buy 1,000 followers?</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg></path></svg></summary><p data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>1,000 Instagram followers cost $15.95 at GetLikes, and 1,000 TikTok followers are the same price. Likes and views cost less because they are cheaper to deliver.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>Does buying followers actually work?</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg></path></svg></summary><p data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>It works for one specific thing: making your profile look established to someone deciding whether to follow you. It will not bring you customers, comments, or a place on the Explore page. Treat it as a nudge, not a growth plan.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>Is it legal to buy followers and likes?</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg></path></svg></summary><p data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>Yes, it is legal. No law stops you paying for followers. It does break the terms of service of Instagram, TikTok and YouTube, so the risk sits with your account rather than with the courts. Platforms usually respond by removing the fake accounts, not by banning the buyer.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>Do you need my password?</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg></path></svg></summary><p data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>No, and we never will. We only need your public username, or a link to the post you want boosted. Any service asking for your password can lock you out of your own account.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>How fast does delivery start?</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg></path></svg></summary><p data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>Most orders start within a few minutes of payment. Small packages often finish the same day, and larger ones are spread out so the growth looks natural.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><summary data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><span data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>What if something goes wrong?</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg></path></svg></summary><p data-astro-cid-gfo3rpqg>Contact us within 7 days. If we missed the delivery window we stated, or the product was not what the page described, you can request a refund under our refund policy. If your counts drop below what you bought, we refill them for free.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="fcta" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><div class="container" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><div class="fcta-card" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><div class="fcta-copy" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><p class="fcta-eyebrow" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm>Get started</p><h2 data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm>Pick a platform and start small</h2><p class="fcta-sub" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm>Every package is a one-time payment. There is no subscription, no account to create, and we never ask for your password. If a delivery is late or short, we refill it or refund it.</p><ul class="fcta-points" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><li data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><span data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm>1</span> Choose a service and size</li><li data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><span data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm>2</span> Enter your username or post link</li><li data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><span data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm>3</span> We start within minutes</li></ul><div class="fcta-proof" data-astro-cid-rufwo4jm><a class="rating is-compact" href="#reviews" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5 by verified Trustindex reviews" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><span class="rating-stars" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="is-full" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><defs data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><linearGradient id="half-1" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><stop offset="50%" stop-color="currentColor" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="transparent" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8L1.5 7.7l5.9-.9z" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="is-full" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><defs data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><linearGradient id="half-2" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><stop offset="50%" stop-color="currentColor" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="transparent" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8L1.5 7.7l5.9-.9z" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="is-full" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><defs data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><linearGradient id="half-3" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><stop offset="50%" stop-color="currentColor" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="transparent" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></stop></linearGradient></defs><path d="M10 1.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8L1.5 7.7l5.9-.9z" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="is-full" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><defs data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><linearGradient id="half-4" data-astro-cid-6t2cpe6p><stop offset="50%" stop-col